<title>USA: Pennzoil Co Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Pennzoil Co Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.23		    $0.34</p>
<p> Net			 57,551		   15,769</p>
<p> Revs		     649,000		  587,341</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  46,818		   46,394</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Excluding $2.6 million in after-tax start-up costs from new Excel Paralubes base oil plant, Q1 1997 recurring income was $60.2 million, or $1.29 per share.</p>
<p>Pennzoil said earnings were up threefold due to higher crude oil and natural gas price realizations, plus aggressive cost cutting and lower interest expense.</p>
<p>First Call Q1 1997 estimate was $1.16 per share.</p>
</text>
